  "uprn": "100023491494",
  "decision_date": "02/04/2020",
  "description": "Prior Approval for change of use of office (Class B1a) to residential (Class C3) to provide 9 self-contained flats",
  "site_name": null,
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "02/04/2020",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "W4 3NP",
  "street_name": "Waldeck Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Notifications",
  "lapsed_date": "02/04/2023",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (02 - EXISTING FIRST FLOOR PLAN, 03 - EXISTING FRONT AND REAR ELEVATIONS, 04 - EXISTING SIDE ELEVATIONS AND SECTION AA, 100 - PROPOSED GROUND FLOOR PLAN REV. B, 101 - PROPOSED FIRST FLOOR PLAN REV. A, 102 - PROPOSED FRONT ELEVATION, DWD.01, Flood Risk Assessment Update dated 04th February 2020) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - 3.\tThe development shall not be occupied until the existing redundant vehicular access to Waldeck Road is permanently closed with kerbs and footway reinstated so that it cannot be used as an access across the pavement.",
    "Condition : 4 - 4.\tNo development shall commence until full details (including manufacturers specifications) of secure covered cycle parking facilities (with space for at least 12 bicycles) for the occupants of, and visitors to, the development have been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved facilities shall conform to current guidance such as the TfL London Cycling Design Standards in design and layout and be fully implemented and be made available for use before the first occupation of the development and thereafter retained for use at all times without obstruction.",
    "Condition : 5 - 5.\tNo dwelling shall be occupied until arrangements have been agreed in writing with the local planning authority and put in place to ensure that, with the exception of disabled persons, no resident of the development shall obtain a resident's parking permit within any controlled parking zone which may be in force in the area at any time.",
    "Condition : 6 - 6.\tBefore development commences details of waste and recycling storage should be submitted to and approved by the local planning authority and thereafter implemented as approved before the use hereby approved first commences or the development is first occupied for any purpose and permanently retained thereafter.",
    "Condition : 7 - 7.\tThe development shall be carried out in accordance with the submitted flood risk assessment (reference 58a Waldeck Road, Hounslow W4 3NP Flood Risk Assessment Update, dated 4 February 2020, contained in the letter prepared by EAS) and the following mitigation measures it details: \r\n-\tGround floor units will be accessed via a new stairwell and first-floor walkway with steps back down to the ground floor units. \r\n-\tAll of the ground floor is to be made water tight up to a minimum flood level of 5.67m AOD in line with Appendix B of the letter from EAS dated 4 February 2020. \r\nThese mitigation measures shall be fully implemented prior to occupation and subsequently in accordance with the scheme's timing/phasing arrangements. The measures detailed above shall be retained and maintained thereafter throughout the lifetime of the development."
  ],
